%N A400388 Triangle read by rows: T(n,k) is the number of solid standard Young tableaux with n cells and cylindric index k.
%C A400388 Given a solid standard Young tableaux S whose shape is a plane partition lambda with first column a 1-d partition alpha, let the cylindric index of S be the number of cylindric plane partitions of shape alpha * k with 0 < k present in the representation of S as a saturated chain of plane partitions ordered by inclusion.
